Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}し
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.50,0:02:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}找不到家的小云雀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.50,0:02:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}お家忘れた　子ひばりは
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.30,0:02:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}在無垠田野上的麥穗間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.30,0:02:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}広い畑の麦の中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.30,0:02:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}雖啼叫呼喚母親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.30,0:02:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}母さんたずねて鳴いたけと
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.10,0:02:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}卻只聞風中麥穗喃喃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.10,0:02:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}風に穂麦が鳴るばかり
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.50,0:02:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.20,0:02:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.00,0:02:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.40,0:02:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.60,0:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.30,0:03:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.90,0:03:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.90,0:03:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.70,0:03:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.20,0:03:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.60,0:03:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.40,0:03:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.50,0:03:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永遠彷徨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又看見了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.00,0:04:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這次是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.60,0:04:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.50,0:04:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過有張海報
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.30,0:04:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬戲團的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.20,0:04:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬戲團的海報
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.00,0:04:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}流浪藝人之夜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs20}藍字：歡樂馬戲團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人愉快的歡樂馬戲團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空中踩鋼鎖 馴獸表演
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.10,0:04:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今年我們又來了 歡樂馬戲團 一年一度的歡樂馬戲哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 真的是馬戲團呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這種東西居然還有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.90,0:05:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧小姐 進來看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.50,0:05:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 快點快點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是那傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.90,0:05:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎麼讓他發現的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.80,0:05:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是誰 是誰登錄了地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了 太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.40,0:06:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想進行採訪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 說實話很喫驚的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想不到還能看見這樣的馬戲團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.60,0:07:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺懷念的啊怎麼說呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.40,0:07:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼您是特意從東京來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.20,0:07:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偶然在網上看見 很感興趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偶然嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 你這種人早點去死好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.00,0:07:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用理他們的 每天晚上都這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.50,0:07:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像那對夫妻的儀式一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然後就是情人的登場
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.20,0:07:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過去年之前一直是那個傢伙扮演的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是世界第一的飛刀手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.40,0:08:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過 不要衝着我來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 到那邊去看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 在這種地方做什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在等爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.90,0:08:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.40,0:08:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來採訪的人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.20,0:08:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過爲什麼要來這種馬戲團採訪呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.80,0:08:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.50,0:08:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿姨你會什麼嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿姨 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.50,0:08:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您不是馬戲團的人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,當然有些本事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讓我看看 讓我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 有吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.80,0:09:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從插劍的箱子裏脫身的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能稍微見一下嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些話想問她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.00,0:09:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.70,0:09:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼大不了的 只是覺得她演技真不錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.90,0:09:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可是團長的寶貝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過你特意從東京跑來的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.30,0:09:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.80,0:09:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在這裏面嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.40,0:09:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 聽說是來採訪的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.70,0:09:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還真是有怪人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.30,0:09:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然採訪這種蹩腳馬戲團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基本上聽名字就夠白癡的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.50,0:09:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼歡樂馬戲團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是這麼覺得吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.40,0:10:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 到這邊來 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別碰我 目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.20,0:10:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 我不碰你 你趕快走開吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.60,0:10:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.30,0:10:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請進
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愛好不錯嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.70,0:10:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.20,0:10:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會幫你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不要再想報仇什麼的蠢事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:33.10,0:10:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,報仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你登錄了地獄通信吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.30,0:10:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總之跟我來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.10,0:10:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很害怕吧 不用擔心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會把你帶到他觸手不及的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你跟我走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.90,0:10:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 放開我 放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.10,0:10:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 別出那麼大聲 我是來幫你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.60,0:11:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這可爲難我了 兄弟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是說好了只說話的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.90,0:11:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請你出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看這個箱子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.30,0:11:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放我出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.20,0:11:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骨女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿目 快放我出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 不是那個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我還以爲肯定沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總之先喫飯吧 回頭再去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又在演出中出錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.40,0:13:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是有誰在我鞋跟上動了手腳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.70,0:13:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.60,0:13:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 振作點 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.10,0:13:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個女孩正在捱打
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你 救救她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.30,0:13:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.20,0:13:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她滿身傷痕 一直在捱打
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.00,0:14:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是身上哪有傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.90,0:14:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雙胞胎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.40,0:14:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是箱子脫身的祕密
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.30,0:14:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨團長的 是另一個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪裏看到那個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像牢房一樣的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.80,0:14:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}找不到家的小云雀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.10,0:15:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}在無垠田野上的麥穗間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個傢伙太過分了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.10,0:15:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}雖啼叫呼喚母親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.30,0:15:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}卻只聞風中麥穗喃喃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是 已經解開了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.20,0:15:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這孩子拜託你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.80,0:15:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.10,0:15:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙要幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.20,0:15:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,詳細情況之後再解釋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趕緊逃離這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.90,0:15:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你會被送往地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.70,0:15:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.80,0:15:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別說了 趕快逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.60,0:15:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你幹什麼 放開我 放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.90,0:15:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}找不到家的迷途小云雀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.90,0:15:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}おうち忘れたまよいごの
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.10,0:16:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}如今孤獨地躲在麥田裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.10,0:16:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}ひばりはひとり麦の中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真努力啊 佩服佩服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是獎勵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.40,0:17:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來啊 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.60,0:17:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}山中狐狸雖不啼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.60,0:17:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}お山の狐は　なかぬけど
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.20,0:17:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an3}淒涼寂寞明月光 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.20,0:17:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an7}暮れてさみしい　月あかり
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.00,0:17:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.60,0:18:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.90,0:18:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快出去 盡說些莫名其妙的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.90,0:18:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難道…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.00,0:18:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原來是她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.70,0:18:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄馬戲團
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明星終於要出場了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很期待哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.70,0:19:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 快騎上去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,騎這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.70,0:19:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再不快點就要被那些手抓住了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.60,0:19:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這我怎麼可能做到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.90,0:19:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,連這點事都做不到嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那沒辦法了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.10,0:19:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你們了 住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.50,0:19:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.30,0:19:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.50,0:20:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能堅持多久呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 救救我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那便向姐姐謝罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.40,0:20:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可憐 知道那孩子因爲你受了多少苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難道你們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲了自己得寵就陷害姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真骯髒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向姐姐謝罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我要謝罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲那傢伙我總是不能出頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想一個人登上舞臺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這哪裏有錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要一個人就夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.50,0:20:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有那個人就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.30,0:20:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她這麼說 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:02.90,0:21:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.80,0:21:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.30,0:21:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.70,0:21:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 要去哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:40.30,0:21:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 我叫你停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我不想去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.60,0:22:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 快停下 不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.30,0:22:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家要離開了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.10,0:22:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿目呢 誰看見阿目了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.10,0:22:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,團長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.50,0:22:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 很合適呢 由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.80,0:22:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,簡直就是絕配
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.60,0:22:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在笑呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.00,0:22:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 出發
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.30,0:23:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.00,0:23:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.50,0:23:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.40,0:23:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:45.50,0:23:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.30,0:23:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.30,0:24:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.30,0:24:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.70,0:24:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.50,0:24:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子是這樣說的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.50,0:24:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是被濃霧籠罩的靜養院
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.30,0:24:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要去 回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.10,0:24:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.00,0:24:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去 不會讓你將人流放到地獄去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.60,0:24:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要去 不可以去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.70,0:24:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 聽到八音盒的聲音了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&\an7}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}玻璃風景
